flowchart LR
    SRC[HyMeKo source] --> PARSE[Parser + lowering]
    PARSE --> IR[(Canonical Ir)]
    UPDATE[Typed transaction] --> IR
    IR --> SNAP[Immutable versioned snapshot]
    SNAP --> STREAM[ir_stream sections]
    STREAM --> REPLICA[Replica / MCU C view]

    IR --> INC[Exact sparse IncidenceIndex]
    INC --> GRAPH[Direct-Ir hypergraph algorithms]
    INC --> OP[B, B^T, B^T B operators]
    OP --> CPU[Serial / Rayon]
    OP --> GPU[WGPU / CUDA / FPGA]
    IR --> XR[WebXR semantic query]
    IR --> HNN[Nagare HNN]

    P0[P0 evidence consolidation] --> P1[P1 benchmark consolidation]
    P1 --> P2[P2 incidence precompute]
    P1 --> P3[P3 direct-Ir locality]
    P1 --> P4[P4 mutable storage study]
    P4 --> P5[P5 transactions]
    P5 --> P6[P6 snapshots + sparse refresh]
    P6 --> P7[P7 distributed apply]
    P0 --> P8[P8 MCU C wire PoW]
    P0 --> P9[P9 WebXR read query]
    P7 --> P9W[P9 durable write-back]
    P2 --> P10[P10 accelerator sparse ops]
    P3 --> P10
    P7 --> P11[P11 single CLI facade]
    P9W --> P11
    P10 --> P11

    BAD1[No parallel IR / graph model]:::reject
    BAD2[No default clique materialization]:::reject
    BAD3[No second CBOR schema]:::reject
